# ========================
# 9.CUSTOM RULES
# ========================
# Add any project-specific files or directories to ignore below
# Anchored: unanchored these matched docs/notes.md, docs/i18n/*/notes.md and
# anything similar -- the likeliest filename for real documentation here.
/[Nn]ote.txt
/[Nn]ote.md
/[Nn]otes.txt
/[Nn]otes.md
temp_data/
debug_info/
/countdata.py
/checkduplicates.py
data.bak/
*.pre_shard

.claude/

# Wrangler working state. web/.gitignore covers web/.wrangler, but running
# wrangler from the REPO ROOT writes .wrangler/ here instead -- which is how
# .wrangler/cache/wrangler-account.json (Cloudflare account id + account email)
# reached a public repo. Unanchored so it holds at any depth.
.wrangler/

# Kotlin incremental build state from `tauri android build`.
.kotlin/
# End of .gitignore file